<title>ITALY: Cirio sees 1996 net profit up, div down.</title>
<headline>Cirio sees 1996 net profit up, div down.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian food group Cirio on Thursday reported a net consolidated profit of 21.5 billion lire in 1996 up from 17.2 billion in 1995, but proposed a reduced dividend of 25 lire a share from 34 lire previously.</p>
<p>Group sales in 1996 were 1.584 trillion lire after 1.553 trillion in 1995, while annual operating profits rose to 65 billion lire from 43 billion lire previously.</p>
<p>((-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502 ))</p>
</text>
